st_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.83811002,36.76345148]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"西平岳","category":"nature","address":"火山景観 / 火山","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"09384","municipality_pref":"栃木県","municipality_name":"塩谷町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"102"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.77066040039062,36.89220428466797]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"釈迦ヶ岳","category":"nature","address":"火山景観 / 火山","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"09384","municipality_pref":"栃木県","municipality_name":"塩谷町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"102"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.77676391601562,36.899986267089844]}}],"display_comment_original":"塩谷町周辺には、近世村の記憶として佐貫村、玉生村、東房村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡に関わる場所が見え、鳥羽新田箒根神社境内遺跡、佐貫石仏のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、佐貫村、玉生村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["船村徹","木下龍太郎","斎藤藤四郎"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["尚仁沢湧水（名水百選）","尚仁沢名水パーク（東荒川ダム親水公園）","道の駅湧水の郷しおや","佐貫観音院（東海寺別院）","佐貫石仏（磨崖仏、国指定の史跡）","高原山水源の森（水源の森百選）"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["故船村徹先生故郷への想いをつなぐ https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/bibnl-23020130","我らの名誉顧問船村徹先生の想いをつなぐ : しもつけの心 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/bibnl-22973049"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A1%A9%E8%B0%B7%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11614112","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11518107","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q108780403","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E8%88%B9%E6%9D%91%E5%BE%B9&keyword=%E5%A1%A9%E8%B0%B7%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"塩谷町","wikipedia_revision_id":"109670581","wikidata_qid":"Q1203439","wikipedia_url":"http